**Button**
```css
.btn {
  font: 700 14px/1 'Square Sans',Inter,'Pretendard',sans-serif;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 0 18px;
  height: 44px;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
